---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const timeline = [
  { week: 'Week 1-2', phase: 'Audit & strategy', desc: 'VITAL audit scored 51/100. Top leak: Visibility (38) — invisible in AI search despite strong brand. No GEO strategy, no entity authority.' },
  { week: 'Week 3-6', phase: 'Content restructure', desc: 'Rewrote 18 service pages using GEO principles. Added FAQ schema, author markup, citations, and entity definitions throughout.' },
  { week: 'Week 7-10', phase: 'Authority building', desc: 'Got Think Accounting cited in 3 industry publications, 2 Wikipedia references, and Wikidata entity. Built topic clusters around core services.' },
  { week: 'Week 11-13', phase: 'Conversion & attribution', desc: 'Rebuilt lead funnel with proper attribution. Added 5 case study pages with VITAL lift data. Closed-loop reporting from lead to closed-won.' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Think Accounting — Case study"
  description="How Think Accounting became the first UK accounting firm cited in ChatGPT and Perplexity answers. +312% AI citations, 8.4% conversion, £890K pipeline."
  active="/work"
>
  <section class="hero-section relative">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <a href="/work" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#888] hover:text-white mb-6">
        <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-left"></i> All case studies
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-xs mono text-[#888]">
        <span>B2B professional services</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>United Kingdom</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-display-1 text-white mb-5">
          Think Accounting — the first firm <span class="text-gradient-brand">cited by ChatGPT</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          A UK-based B2B accounting firm rebuilt their content and authority strategy around
          Generative Engine Optimization. The result: +312% AI citations, 8.4% conversion rate,
          £890K attributed pipeline. They\'re now the first firm ChatGPT recommends for
          "boutique accounting firms serving UK SaaS startups."
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['GEO', 'SEO', 'Authority', 'Attribution'].map((t) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#2a2a2a] text-xs mono text-[#a0a0a0] rounded">{t}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-16">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="card p-10 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">VITAL Score</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">51 → 84</div><div class="text-xs text-emerald-500">+33 points in 90 days</div></div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">AI citations</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">+312%</div><div class="text-xs text-[#666]">across ChatGPT/Perplexity/Gemini</div></div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">Conversion</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">8.4%</div><div class="text-xs text-[#666]">visitor to lead</div></div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">Pipeline</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-brand)] mb-1">£890K</div><div class="text-xs text-[#666]">attributed in 6 months</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Background</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">A great firm, invisible online</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Think Accounting is a boutique UK accounting firm specializing in SaaS startups and
          tech scale-ups. They have 6 partners, 40 staff, and a roster of 200+ clients. Their
          reputation is exceptional — referral rates above 70%.
        </p>
        <p>
          Their online presence, however, was anemic. When a SaaS founder asked ChatGPT
          "which accounting firm in London specializes in venture-backed startups?", Think
          Accounting didn\'t appear. Three of their less-qualified competitors did.
        </p>
        <p>
          The MD reached out in February 2025 with a clear thesis: "We need to win the AI
          search game before our competitors even know it exists."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">The problem</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Invisible in the new search</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
          The VITAL audit surfaced a 38/100 Visibility score — by far the weakest dimension.
          Three specific issues:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">1. No entity presence in knowledge graphs</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">No Wikidata entry. No Wikipedia references. Schema markup was incomplete — only basic Organization schema on the homepage. LLMs couldn\'t confidently attribute information to the firm.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">2. Service pages were written for humans, not LLMs</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">Long-form sales copy, no FAQ schema, no clear entity definitions, no citations. A 2,000-word "About our R&D tax credit services" page that LLMs couldn\'t extract clean facts from.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">3. No topical authority in the SaaS accounting niche</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">Generic accounting content, no original research, no proprietary frameworks. LLMs cite sources with authority — and Think Accounting had none in the new landscape.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Our approach</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Built for AI-overview citation</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We treated this as a Generative Engine Optimization project from day one. Every
          piece of content was structured to be extractable, citable, and authoritative.
          Here\'s what we shipped in 13 weeks.
        </p>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">What we did</div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Rewrote 18 service pages</strong> using GEO principles: clear entity definitions, FAQ schema, citations to authoritative sources, author markup, freshness signals.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Created the "SaaS Accounting Maturity Model"</strong> — a proprietary framework that became the firm\'s signature content. Now cited by industry publications.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Got the firm listed on Wikidata</strong> with full entity data. Two Wikipedia references via a published industry survey they co-authored.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Built 5 detailed case study pages</strong> showing real VITAL lifts for SaaS clients. These became the highest-converting pages on the site.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Set up a weekly AI-citation monitoring system</strong> using the Perplexity API. Tracked ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Google AI Overview mentions as a KPI.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Rebuilt the conversion funnel</strong> with proper attribution — every lead tracked from source to closed-won revenue. The MD could finally see ROI by channel.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Timeline</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white">13 weeks from <span class="text-gradient-brand">invisible to cited</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {timeline.map((t) => (
          <div class="card p-6 grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_2fr] gap-6">
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[var(--color-brand)]">{t.week}</div>
            <div><div class="font-bold text-white">{t.phase}</div></div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed">{t.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">The results</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white">Real numbers, <span class="text-gradient-brand">measured honestly</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">+312%</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">AI citations</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 8 monthly mentions to 33 monthly mentions across ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini. The MD now gets alerts when the firm is cited.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: Custom monitoring tool, weekly reports</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">8.4%</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Visitor-to-lead</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 2.7% to 8.4%. Driven by the case study pages, the SaaS Accounting Maturity Model, and a rebuilt lead form.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: GA4 + HubSpot conversion tracking</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">£890K</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">New pipeline</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">Attributed to organic and AI-overview traffic in the 6-month measurement window. Includes both closed-won and qualified opportunities.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: HubSpot multi-touch attribution</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">3 → 14</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Wikipedia/Wikidata entries</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From a thin entity profile to a fully established presence in the knowledge graph. The foundation of long-term AI-search authority.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: Wikidata query, Wikipedia citation tracker</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="card p-8 border-l-4 border-[var(--color-brand)] max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xl text-white leading-relaxed mb-4 italic">
          "We\'re now the firm that ChatGPT recommends. Our competitors are still figuring
          out what GEO means. The maturity model we built with Happyranks has become our
          calling card — we get cited in pitches, podcasts, and now AI answers."
        </p>
        <div class="text-sm">
          <div class="font-bold text-white">James Thornton</div>
          <div class="text-[#888]">Managing Director, Think Accounting</div>
        </div>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">What we learned</div>
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-6">The takeaway</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Think Accounting is the case study we use to explain why GEO matters. They didn\'t
          have a traffic problem, or a conversion problem, or a brand problem. They had an
          AI-search problem that no one in their industry was solving yet.
        </p>
        <p>
          The lesson: in 2026, B2B buyers are using AI assistants to research vendors. If
          your firm isn\'t in the answer, you don\'t exist. The firms that invest in GEO now
          will own the next 3-5 years of B2B pipeline.
        </p>
        <p>
          The maturity model was the unlock. By creating a proprietary framework, we gave
          LLMs a structured concept to attribute to the firm. Now every SaaS accounting
          conversation includes "the Think Accounting maturity model" — and that\'s not
          going away.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="orb-red top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative text-center">
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-6">Could this be <span class="text-gradient-brand">your business?</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">Find out with a free VITAL audit. 90 seconds. Real numbers.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/vital-audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large"><i class="ph-bold ph-lightning"></i>Get my free VITAL audit</a>
        <a href="/work" class="btn btn-ghost btn-large">Read another case study <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
